  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC humanitarian action in Ethiopia 2022-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia is challenged by drought, internal armed conflict, cholera outbreak and major price increases on food and fertiliser. This allocation contributes to meeting the objectives of the ICRC Ethiopia country appeal for 2022. Activities include delivering relief and essential services, protection, life-saving health care, restore livelihoods, clean water, restoring family links, and helping detainees&#x2019; treatment and living conditions. 

Due to its nature as a response to a humanitarian appeal operational results are general and highly aggregated and the MFA contribution is thus reflected in the overall results reporting by the partner.  Please refer to the hyperlink below.

https://www.icrc.org/en/resource-centre</narrative>
  </description>
